^{:go/end 218} (go/method snapshotStat "snapshotStat returns the snapshot of the goroutine execution statistics.\nThis is called as we process the ordered trace event stream. lastTs is used\nto process pending statistics if this is called before any goroutine end event.\n" [^{:tag (* GoroutineSummary)} g ^Time lastTs] :results [^GoroutineExecStats ret]
