^{:go/end 243} (go/method finalize "finalize is called when processing a goroutine end event or at\nthe end of trace processing. This finalizes the execution stat\nand any active regions in the goroutine, in which case trigger is nil.\n" [^{:tag (* GoroutineSummary)} g ^Time lastTs ^{:tag (* Event)} trigger]
